    "source_sections": {
      "fingerprint": true,
      "preconditions": true,
      "remediation": true,
      "references": true
    },
    "remediation_source": "- 升级到 7.0.100 / 8.5.51 / 9.0.31+；AJP 只绑 127.0.0.1，并设置 `secret`（`requiredSecret`）。\n- 不需要 AJP 时直接注释掉 `<Connector protocol=\"AJP/1.3\">`。",
